 <ThingDef ParentName="EH_OtherworldOutfitBase"><defName>EH_OtherworldGakuran</defName><label>otherworld boys' academy uniform</label><description>A fitted charcoal/navy Japanese boys' gakuran with a low band collar, brass buttons and an integrated trouser panel. Called men wear this outfit. Ordinary cloth clothing covers torso, shoulders, arms, waist and legs; it is removable and has normal durability.</description><graphicData><texPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/OtherworldGakuran/OtherworldGakuran</texPath></graphicData><apparel><wornGraphicPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/OtherworldGakuran/OtherworldGakuran</wornGraphicPath><gender>Male</gender></apparel></ThingDef>
 <ThingDef ParentName="EH_OtherworldOutfitBase"><defName>EH_OtherworldSailor</defName><label>otherworld girls' academy uniform</label><description>A fitted ivory/navy Japanese schoolgirl sailor uniform with a compact flat yoke, burgundy bow and opaque pleated lower panel. Called women wear this outfit. Ordinary cloth clothing covers torso, shoulders, arms, waist and legs; it is removable and has normal durability.</description><graphicData><texPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/OtherworldSailor/OtherworldSailor</texPath></graphicData><apparel><wornGraphicPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/OtherworldSailor/OtherworldSailor</wornGraphicPath><gender>Female</gender></apparel></ThingDef>
